message.content:
以下是一份符合您需求的一日行程安排，並在每一步說明將會呼叫哪個功能（如果實際執行時請使用對應的 API 呼叫）：

| 時間 | 行動 | 地點 / 資訊 | 功能調用 |
|------|------|-------------|----------|
| **早上** | 從「123 Main Street」前往「456 Park Avenue」（辦公室），預算 ≤ \$30 | 起點：123 Main St<br>終點：456 Park Ave | `ride_hailing_get_rides({"source":"123 Main Street","destination":"456 Park Avenue","max_cost":30})` |
| **午休/傍晚** | 在「789 Broadway」Whole‑Foods 超市線上訂購雜貨（牛奶、麵包、雞蛋、蘋果），配送費 ≤ \$10 | 商店位置：789 Broadway<br>商品清單：["milk","bread","eggs","apples"] | `grocery_delivery_order({"location":"789 Broadways","items":["milk","bread","eggs","apples"],"max_delivery_cost":10})` |
| **晚上** | 從辦公室「456 Park Avenue」前往好友住址「321 Elm Street」，預算 ≤ \$20 | 出發地：456 Park Ave<br>目的地：321 Elm St | `ride_hailing_get_rides({"source":"456 Park Avenue","destination":"321 Elm Street","max_cost":20})` |
| **深夜** | 從好友住所「321 Elm Street」返回自己住宅「123 Main Street」，預算 ≤ \$25 | 起點：321 Elm St<br>終點：123 Main St | `ride_hailing_get_rides({"source":"321 Elm Street","destination":"123 Main Street","max_cost":25})` |

---

### 如何進行操作

1. **查詢第一段路程**  
   ```json
   {
     "name": "ride_hailing_get_rides",
     "arguments": {"source":"123 Main Street","destination":"456 Park Avenue","max_cost":30}
   }
   ```

2. **完成雜貨訂購**  
   ```json
   {
     "name": "grocery_delivery_order",
     "arguments": {"location":"789 Broadway","items":["milk","bread","eggs","apples"],"max_delivery_cost":10}
   }
   ```

3. **查詢第二段路程**  
   ```json
   {
     "name": "ride_hailing_get_rides",
     "arguments": {"source":"456 Park Avenue","destination":"321 Elm Street","max_cost":20}
   }
   ```

4. **查詢第三段路程**  
   ```json
   {
     "name": "ride_hailing_get_rides",
     "arguments": {"source":"321 Elm Street","destination":"123 Main Street","max_cost":25}
   }
   ```

只要按上述順序依次送出即可得到相應的車輛選項與價格資訊，以及確保您的雜貨已經成功排隊等待配送。

祝旅途愉快！
